{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國財政部下屬的金融犯罪執法網絡（FinCEN）於周二表示，正在調查一起「網絡安全事件」。該機構稱，此次事件導致其「一小部分系統遭到未經授權訪問」，但尚未説明事件的整體範圍、入侵來源或是否涉及敏感數據。作為預防措施，FinCEN已將部分系統暫時下線。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587918.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T06:43:53.606651+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T06:28:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T06:37:13.741601+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T06:37:13.741601+00:00","content_hash":"f8b295bc8218aa642eb942f1396418953a456a0e3c654e204b3848794990df3e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}